OL,3,GNEWSAIrish politician injured after
OL,4,Aassault in Dublin
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Irish politician has been assaulted
OL,7,Fafter his car was stopped in traffic in
OL,8,Fcentral Dublin.
OL,10,FIndependent TD Michael Healy-Rae was
OL,11,Fattacked by a lone man after 16:00
OL,12,Flocal time on Wednesday afternoon.
OL,14,FHealy-Rae was stopped at a traffic
OL,15,Flight on Cork Street when a passerby
OL,16,Fwalked over to the open car window and
OL,17,Fpunched him in the face.
OL,19,FThe politician has been released from
OL,20,FSt Vincent's University Hospital where
OL,21,Fhe received treatment for his injuries.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
